    <bpmn:process id="W_W3889" name="W3889. Customer Segmentation &amp; Targeting Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Segment need (links to W3887); campaign brief (links to VS-14)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~50–200 active segments; refreshed daily/real-time
Owner: CDP / Marketing
Participants: CDP Team, Marketing (links to VS-14), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Trade/Key Account (links to VS-11/VS-107), Insights (links to VS-28.1/VS-44), Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3889 — Customer Segmentation &amp; Targeting Operations</bpmn:documentation>
