        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-608 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Segmentation, Activation &amp; Personalization Foundation (PA-126.2).) | - operational: daily/real-time refresh; operational: build-time enforcement (links to W3885)
Owner: CDP / Marketing</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
