    <bpmn:process id="W_W3890" name="W3890. Real-Time Customer Profile &amp; Next-Best-Action Serving" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer-identified interaction (POS, ecommerce, app, contact center)
Frequency: Real-time
Volume: Millions of profile lookups/month across touchpoints
Owner: CDP / IT
Participants: CDP Team, IT (links to VS-27/VS-113), Marketing (links to VS-14), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Sales Enablement/Clienteling (links to VS-124), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), POS (links to VS-08), Contact Center (links to VS-13), Data Science (links to VS-30.2)
Source: workflow W3890 — Real-Time Customer Profile &amp; Next-Best-Action Serving</bpmn:documentation>
