    <bpmn:process id="W_W3891" name="W3891. Audience Activation &amp; Cross-Channel Syndication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Segment ready (W3889); campaign launch (links to VS-14)
Frequency: Per campaign + continuous
Volume: ~hundreds of activations/month across email/SMS/push/paid-media/in-store
Owner: CDP / Marketing
Participants: CDP Team, Marketing (links to VS-14), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Mobile App (links to VS-75), Store Ops/Comms (links to VS-07/VS-63), Paid Media/Agency (links to VS-14.2), Privacy (links to VS-91), IT (links to VS-27/VS-113)
Source: workflow W3891 — Audience Activation &amp; Cross-Channel Syndication</bpmn:documentation>
