    <bpmn:process id="W_W3892" name="W3892. Personalization &amp; Recommendation Engine Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Online/app interaction; NBA need (links to W3890)
Frequency: Real-time + model cycle
Volume: Millions of recommendation impressions/month
Owner: CDP / Data Science
Participants: CDP Team, Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Mobile App (links to VS-75), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Marketing (links to VS-14), Insights (links to VS-28.1), Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3892 — Personalization &amp; Recommendation Engine Operations</bpmn:documentation>
