      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3892_Task4" name="CDP/Data Science operate recommendation engines: &quot;frequently bought…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Data Science operate recommendation engines: &quot;frequently bought together&quot;/&quot;customers also bought&quot; (attachment links to VS-124), category cross-sell, project-basket completion (links to VS-66 design), recently-viewed, and trade-pro bundle (links to VS-43) — powered by the profile (links to W3884) and catalog (links to VS-01.3)
Responsible (R): CDP / Data Science / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3892_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3892_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
