        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Insights run multi-touch attribution (MTA) and/or marketing-mix modeling (MMM) across channels (paid media links to VS-14.2, loyalty links to VS-13, email/SMS/push, ecommerce links to VS-10, in-store links to VS-07), reconciling to sales (links to VS-17.4)
