    <bpmn:process id="W_W3896" name="W3896. Campaign &amp; Offer Measurement (Lift, ROI)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Campaign close (links to VS-14); promotion end (links to VS-58)
Frequency: Per campaign + quarterly
Volume: ~6 major campaigns/yr + monthly hot deals + loyalty/promo
Owner: CDP / Insights
Participants: CDP Team, Insights (links to VS-28.1), Marketing (links to VS-14), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Merchandising (links to VS-01/VS-101), Trade (links to VS-11/VS-107), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Coupons/Promo (links to VS-58)
Source: workflow W3896 — Campaign &amp; Offer Measurement (Lift, ROI)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3896_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3896_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3896_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3896_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3896_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3896_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3896_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3896_Start3" name="Campaign close (links to VS-14); promotion end (links to VS-58)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3896_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3896_Task4" name="CDP/Insights measure campaign/offer incrementality: treatment-vs-control lift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Insights measure campaign/offer incrementality: treatment-vs-control lift, incremental revenue/margin, halo (links to VS-01 category), cannibalization, and cost (incl. discount/MDR links to VS-80) per campaign/offer
Responsible (R): CDP / Insights / Marketing
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3896_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3896_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3896_Task5" name="CDP/Merchandising/Finance measure margin impact (markdown links to VS-101…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Merchandising/Finance measure margin impact (markdown links to VS-101, promo-leakage links to VS-118) and trade/promo ROI (links to VS-128), and flag unprofitable offers
Responsible (R): CDP / Merchandising / Finance
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3896_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3896_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3896_Task6" name="CDP/Marketing publish results, retire under-performing offers, scale winners…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Marketing publish results, retire under-performing offers, scale winners (links to VS-14/VS-58/VS-101), and report CDP-attributed value to the steering committee (links to W3881/W3904)
Responsible (R): CDP / Marketing / Insights
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3896_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3896_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3896_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3896_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3896_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-608 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Segmentation, Activation &amp; Personalization Foundation (PA-126.2).) | - operational: control groups; operational: margin-adjusted ROI
Owner: CDP / Insights</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
